**** History ****

Ver. 1.0
  - First release -
  Creates, uploads, and receives new mail from PCBoard systems

Ver. 1.1
  - Added support for Soundex search
  - Added support for the "Language" prompt (But it only works with
    default PCBoard prompts... PCBoard 14.5 tested only)

Ver. 1.2
  - Added support for the Echo mail prompt
  - Mail packets are now downloaded to your mail directory
